idget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"b4cd993\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ed91fb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0ed91fb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1feb8c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1feb8c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1575\">Agradecimento e compromisso<\/h6><p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1851\">A Devlop agradece a todos os que visitaram o stand da Agenda NEXUS, partilharam ideias e contribu\u00edram para o sucesso desta participa\u00e7\u00e3o. Levamos connosco n\u00e3o s\u00f3 novos contactos, mas tamb\u00e9m uma motiva\u00e7\u00e3o renovada para continuar a <strong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1848\">inovar e transformar a log\u00edstica global<\/strong>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6b59d7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b6b59d7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quo